  "details": "Description\n\nI took a photo to set as my profile icon. It works just fine, but every time I reload VRChat it resets to the default profile icon (which is my avatar's thumbnail). The picture I took is still there as an option, it just won't stay selected.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nI don't know why it's doing this, but it happens every time I reload the game. (The profile icon will not reset between worlds or when I change an avatar.)\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: User Interface\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1886-a268441585-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-08-15_12-59-10.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_bb4ae5ed-9935-4113-b980-eabcf5051b4a/1/file)",
